  "prefLabel": "Mec 801.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 801.02 Scope.\n\n(a) These rules shall establish voluntary water treatment certification program for the following:\n\n(1) Individuals involved in the installation of residential and non-residential water treatment systems; and\n\n(2) Individuals involved in the servicing and repair of water treatment systems.\n\n(b) No person shall hold themselves out as a certified water treatment technician unless the certification was obtained pursuant to these rules.\n\n(c) No person less than 18 years of age shall be issued a certificate pursuant to these rules.\n\nSource. #13632, eff 7-19-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec800.html"
}
